[[16,96,16384,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The supply for the rev counter module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               reaches\npins 10 and 16 of connector A directly from the battery. (maxifuse\nJ/B2 of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) via fuses \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F3</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of junction\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ; this supply is used by the check device for the\nexterior lights.</p><p>Rev counter module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               receives a\nsupply controlled by the ignition (INT) at pin 15 of connector A\nfrom the line protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional fuse box \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              . Pin 14 of connector A is earthed.</p><p>The engine rpm signal, which is different\nfor each engine type, comes from the engine management control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               to\npin 6 of connector B.</p><p>In particular, for versions with automatic\ntransmission, the connecting line - pin 12 of connector B of module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               \n-  to the gearbox management control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               - pin 10 of\nconnector A - is used for the instrument&#x27;s gear indicator display\nand the &#x27;automatic transmission fault&#x27; warning light.</p><p>For all the other warning lights, refer\nto the diagrams relating to the components to which they refer.</p>"]]